                <pb facs="0222" n="142" xml:id="pg142"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Conger to
                            Chang Kai-chin.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-02-24"><hi rendition="#italic">February 24,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am very much pleased to receive telegram of thanks from children of Chang
                    Yin-huan. Appreciate it very highly.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Conger</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
